    "excerptEn": "NTPC Limited has released Advertisement No. 12/26 for the recruitment of 15 Assistant Officer (Corporate Communication) vacancies. Apply online by 5 October 2026.",
    "excerpt": "NTPC Limited has released Advertisement No. 12/26 for the recruitment of 15 Assistant Officer (Corporate Communication) vacancies. Apply online by 5 October 2026.",
